# Apple code is reference-only

`third_party/ml-pararnn` is Apple Inc. software under a **custom non-MIT license** (personal, non-exclusive; no trademark use; AS IS). It is gitignored and must not be redistributed as this project's code.

- Read it to understand Jacobians, Newton, PCR, and CUDA layout.
- Do **not** paste, translate, or "clean up" their Python/CUDA into `src/`.
- Our implementation follows the **paper** (equations, Alg. 1, App. A/C/D). If the paper and the Apple repo disagree, note both and follow the paper unless we document a measured reason.
- Our public license (planned MIT) covers **our** code only. Do not claim Apple's kernels are MIT.
